か、明日になっても、こんな些細な問題で二の足を踏んで、またやつを逃してしまう気じゃないよな？","nextNodeIds":[735140105]},{"nodeId":735140105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":3251250210,"text":"うっ…でも、パラメータが…","nextNodeIds":[735140106]},{"nodeId":735140106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":3912079730,"text":"もう計った。チャージ速度は設計値より低くなるけど、使用する分には問題ないはずだ。それに安全面の懸念だってない。","nextNodeIds":[735140107]},{"nodeId":735140107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":543442666,"text":"シュリヤ…分かってるさ。すべてをちゃんと分析してから始めたいんだろ。でも君も知ってるはずだ。実際の状況がいつも計算通りにいくわけじゃないって。","nextNodeIds":[735140108]},{"nodeId":735140108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":1032572410,"text":"万全を期すことに拘り過ぎて逆にチャンスを逃してしまったら、以前の中期発表のときみたいに、延期という悲惨な結末を招くことになる…そうすれば、結局さらなる問題を生み出してしまうだけさ。","nextNodeIds":[735140109]},{"nodeId":735140109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":1391284810,"text":"はぁ…わかったわよ…ほら、持っていきなさい。点火モジュールよ。","nextNodeIds":[735140110]},{"nodeId":735140110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":260284874,"text":"——よーし！明日こそ「対ウェネト殺蟲大砲」の見せ場だな！","nextNodeIds":[735140111]},{"nodeId":735140111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","textMapHash":2668653874,"text":"アアル村まで持って帰って、再調整してみるよ。「対ウェネト殺蟲大砲」の初陣なんだ…ちゃんと準備しとかないと。","nextNodeIds":[735140112]},{"nodeId":735140112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":2231905258,"text":"…でも環境パラメータのほうは、どうして誤差が生じたんでしょう？そもそも、ウェネトはどうして突然暴れ出したのよ。","nextNodeIds":[735140113]},{"nodeId":735140113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":1899545466,"text":"やっぱりこの問題をほったらかしておくわけにはいかない…冒険者さん、申し訳ないんだけど、明日もまた来てくれない？","nextNodeIds":[735140114]},{"nodeId":735140114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","textMapHash":432304378,"text":"明日はウェネトに直面することになるし、多少なりとも研究成果があればいいんだけど。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7351401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30342"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7351401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30342,"speakerName":"ヴィナヤック","count":8},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30343,"speakerName":"シュリヤ","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173514],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":410403566,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/V3.6SandSworm/Q7351401","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":735140101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","ILHDNJDDEOP":7351401,"JGFEJPBPHGJ":[],"JNFAMBOFGHJ":false,"KINCAGMDMHH":[30343,30342],"KJLNGKKBBOI":"TALK_MARK_NONE","KNBDEPPFNBN":0,"LCIDOOMOIPM":0,"LIJPPLJCHGI":0,"LMAPLNHKPOH":[],"MBDOOOMPFCD":false,"